#: ../../templates.rst:183
msgid "Finding templates"
msgstr "查找模板"

#: ../../templates.rst:186
msgid ""
"Guidedog searches each directory listed in ``conf.toml`` under "
"``templates_path`` in order, followed by its built-in templates. Template "
"names are relative to the directories in ``templates_path``. They cannot "
"escape those directories with parent directory traversal (``..``)."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 按顺序搜索 ``conf.toml`` 中 ``templates_path`` 列出的每个目录，最后搜索内置模板。模板名相对于 "
"``templates_path`` 中的目录，不能通过上级目录（``..``）跳出这些目录。"

#: ../../templates.rst:190
msgid ""
"Every file and subdirectory in ``templates_path`` is an input dependency "
"of the build. When a template or partial file is added, edited, or "
"removed, ``guidedog build`` and the live server ``guidedog serve`` detect "
"the change and render the site again."
msgstr ""
"``templates_path`` 中的每个文件和子目录都是构建的输入依赖。添加、修改或删除模板或片段文件后，``guidedog "
"build`` 和实时服务器 ``guidedog serve`` 都会检测到变化，并重新渲染网站。"

