"``show_copyright``, ``show_sphinx``, ``show_guidedog``, ``has_source``, "
"``show_source``"
msgstr ""
"``show_copyright``\\ , ``show_sphinx``\\ , ``show_guidedog``\\ , "
"``has_source``\\ , ``show_source``"

#: ../../templates.rst:248
msgid "The ``html_show_*`` and ``html_copy_source`` settings."
msgstr "``html_show_*`` 和 ``html_copy_source`` 配置项。"

#: ../../templates.rst:249
msgid "``builder``, ``file_suffix``"
msgstr "``builder``\\ , ``file_suffix``"

#: ../../templates.rst:250
msgid "The builder's name, such as ``html``, and the page suffix."
msgstr "构建器名称，例如 ``html``\\ ，以及页面后缀。"

#: ../../templates.rst:251
msgid "every key of ``html_context``"
msgstr "``html_context`` 中的每个键"

#: ../../templates.rst:252
msgid ""
"Its value, with its type, as Sphinx passes a Python value: ``false`` is "
"false in ``{% if %}``, numbers are numbers, arrays are lists, and tables "
"are dicts whose keys keep the order ``conf.toml`` gives them. ``guidedog "
"migrate`` carries the literal entries of ``conf.py``'s ``html_context``. "
"A value ``conf.py`` computes is left undefined, which a template reads as "
"false."
msgstr ""
"其值保留类型，与 Sphinx 传递 Python 值的方式一致：``false`` 在 ``{% if %}`` "
"中为假，数值仍是数值，数组是列表，表是字典，键的顺序与 ``conf.toml`` 中一致。``guidedog migrate`` 会迁移 "
"``conf.py`` 中 ``html_context`` 的字面量条目。由 ``conf.py`` 计算得出的值保持未定义，模板会将其视为假。"

#: ../../templates.rst:258
msgid ""
"``pathto`` is Sphinx's template function. ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` "
"is the URL of a document's page, and ``pathto(\"_static/logo.svg\", 1)`` "
"the URL of a file below the site's root, both relative to the current "
"page. With the singlehtml builder, as with Sphinx's, a document is its "
"section of the single page: ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` is "
"``#document-usage-install`` on that page and "
"``index.html#document-usage-install`` on the index and search pages. A "
"name that is no document's, such as ``genindex`` or a page made from a "
"template (below), is a page at the site's root with every builder."
msgstr ""
"``pathto`` 是 Sphinx 的模板函数。\\ ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` 返回文档页面的 URL，\\ "
"``pathto(\"_static/logo.svg\", 1)`` 返回站点根目录下文件的 URL，均相对于当前页面。singlehtml 与 "
"Sphinx 一样，把文档作为单页中的一节：该页上 ``pathto(\"usage/install\")`` 为 "
"``#document-usage-install``\\ ；索引和搜索页上为 "
"``index.html#document-usage-install``\\ 。\\ ``genindex`` "
"或下述模板页等非文档名称，在所有构建器中都是站点根目录页面。"

#: ../../templates.rst:266
msgid "Pages made from templates"
msgstr "由模板生成的页面"

#: ../../templates.rst:269
msgid ""
"``html_additional_pages`` makes pages from a template alone, as in "
"Sphinx. Each key is a page's name and each value a template in "
"``templates_path``:"
msgstr ""
"``html_additional_pages`` 与 Sphinx 一样，仅用模板创建页面。每个键是页面名称，值是 "
"``templates_path`` 中的模板："

#: ../../templates.rst:273
msgid "conf.toml"
msgstr "conf.toml"

#: ../../templates.rst:281
msgid ""
"A page's template usually extends ``layout.html`` and fills its blocks, "
"so the page looks like every other one:"
msgstr "页面模板通常继承 ``layout.html`` 并填充其区块，让页面与其他页面风格一致："

#: ../../templates.rst:285
msgid "_templates/indexcontent.html"
msgstr "_templates/indexcontent.html"

#: ../../templates.rst:294
msgid ""
"The template sees the variables of a page that is no document's: "
"``pagename`` is the page's name (``index``), ``title`` and ``body`` are "
"empty, and ``pathto``, ``toc``, ``toctree()``, and the values of "
"``html_context`` work as on any page. The page is written at the site's "
"root as ``<name>.html`` (``html_file_suffix``) by ``html``, ``dirhtml``, "
"and ``singlehtml``, and written again on every build. A change to its "
"template, as to any file in ``templates_path``, rebuilds every page."
msgstr ""
"模板得到的是不属于任何文档的页面变量：``pagename`` 是页面名（``index``），``title`` 和 ``body`` "
"为空，``pathto``、``toc``、``toctree()`` 以及 ``html_context`` "
"中的值与普通页面一样可用。``html``、``dirhtml`` 和 ``singlehtml`` 都会把该页面写到网站根目录，文件名为 "
"``<name>.html`` （``html_file_suffix``），并在每次构建时重新写入。修改它的模板，就像修改 "
"``templates_path`` 中的任何文件一样，会重建所有页面。"

#: ../../templates.rst:301
msgid "Where the page goes, and where it differs from Sphinx:"
msgstr "页面位置及与 Sphinx 的差异："

#: ../../templates.rst:303
msgid ""
"A page named as a document takes that document's place, as in Sphinx, "
"where it is written last. ``index = \"landing.html\"`` makes the landing "
"page ``index.html``, while ``index.rst`` still gives the table of "
"contents its entries. With ``singlehtml`` the single page keeps its place "
"and the template page is not written, with a warning."
msgstr ""
"与文档同名的页面会取代该文档，这与 Sphinx 一致（Sphinx 最后写入它）。``index = \"landing.html\"`` "
"会让落地页成为 ``index.html``，而 ``index.rst`` 仍为目录提供条目。使用 ``singlehtml`` "
"时，单个页面保持原位，模板页面不会写入，并给出警告。"

#: ../../templates.rst:307
msgid ""
"``dirhtml`` writes the page as ``download.html``, beside "
"``genindex.html`` and ``search.html``, where Sphinx writes "
"``download/index.html``. ``pathto(\"download\")`` gives that file."
msgstr ""
"``dirhtml`` 把页面写为 ``download.html``，与 ``genindex.html`` 和 ``search.html`` "
"并列；Sphinx 则写为 ``download/index.html``。``pathto(\"download\")`` 返回的就是这个文件。"

#: ../../templates.rst:310
msgid ""
"A name must be a file name at the site's root: ``\"sub/page\"`` is "
"refused with a warning (``build.additional_page``), since the page's "
"links are made from the root. So is a name whose file the site already "
"has, such as ``genindex``, where Sphinx would write one of the two over "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"名称必须是根目录文件名。\\ ``\"sub/page\"`` 会被警告拒绝（\\ ``build.additional_page``\\ "
"），因为页面链接以根目录为基准。\\ ``genindex`` 等已占用文件名也会被拒绝；Sphinx 在此会覆盖其中一页。"

#: ../../templates.rst:314
msgid ""
"``guidedog migrate`` carries ``html_additional_pages`` over from "
"``conf.py``."
msgstr ""
"``guidedog migrate`` 会迁移 ``conf.py`` 中的 ``html_additional_pages``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:316
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "错误"

#: ../../templates.rst:319
msgid ""
"A mistake in a template stops the build with the template's file and "
"line, the line itself, and a suggestion:"
msgstr "模板出错会停止构建，并报告文件、行号、该行内容和修改建议："

#: ../../templates.rst:330
msgid "A variable that is not defined renders as nothing, as in Jinja."
msgstr "未定义的变量渲染为空，与 Jinja 一致。"

#: ../../templates.rst:332
msgid ""
"Runaway templates stop with an error too, never a crash. The limits are: "
"syntax nested more than 100 levels deep (brackets, tags, and each link of "
"a long chain of operators, filters or ``elif`` branches); macros, "
"includes and recursive loops more than 200 deep; and any recursion "
"needing more than 512 KiB of stack. A list that contains itself prints as "
"``[...]``, as in Python."
msgstr ""
"失控的模板同样会报错停止，而不会崩溃。限制如下：语法嵌套超过 100 层（括号、标签，以及由运算符、过滤器或 ``elif`` "
"分支组成的长链中的每一环）；宏、包含和递归循环超过 200 层；任何需要超过 512 KiB 栈空间的递归。包含自身的列表会像 Python "
"一样显示为 ``[...]``。"

#: ../../templates.rst:339
msgid "PDF templates"
msgstr "PDF 模板"

#: ../../templates.rst:342
msgid ""
"The PDF book is typeset by Typst. ``_templates/book.typ`` is an ordinary "
"Typst file that defines a ``book`` function. Guidedog writes the book's "
"source as"
msgstr ""
"PDF 书籍由 Typst 排版。``_templates/book.typ`` 是一个定义了 ``book`` 函数的普通 Typst "
"文件。Guidedog 生成的书籍源文件形式如下"

#: ../../templates.rst:352
msgid ""
"so everything that decides how the book looks is in that file: fonts, "
"page size and margins, headings, the title page, running heads, and the "
"table of contents."
msgstr "因此，决定图书外观的一切都在该文件中：字体、页面尺寸与边距、标题、扉页、页眉和目录。"

#: ../../templates.rst:355
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../templates.rst:362
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../templates.rst:365
msgid "The book's ``title`` in ``pdf_documents``, otherwise ``project``."
msgstr "``pdf_documents`` 中的图书 ``title``\\ ，否则为 ``project``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:366
msgid "``author``"
msgstr "``author``"

#: ../../templates.rst:367
msgid "The book's ``author``, otherwise ``author``."
msgstr "图书的 ``author``\\ ，否则为 ``author`` 配置项。"

#: ../../templates.rst:368
msgid "``version``"
msgstr "``version``"

#: ../../templates.rst:369
msgid "``release``."
msgstr "``release``\\ ."

#: ../../templates.rst:370
msgid "``date``"
msgstr "``date``"

#: ../../templates.rst:371
msgid ""
"``|today|``: ``today`` when it is set, otherwise the build date in "
"``today_fmt``."
msgstr "``|today|``\\ ：若设置了 ``today`` 则使用其值，否则按 ``today_fmt`` 显示构建日期。"

#: ../../templates.rst:372
msgid "``lang``"
msgstr "``lang``"

#: ../../templates.rst:373
msgid "``language``."
msgstr "``language``\\ ."

#: ../../templates.rst:374
msgid "``paper``"
msgstr "``paper``"

#: ../../templates.rst:375
msgid ""
"``\"a4\"``, or ``\"us-letter\"`` when ``pdf_paper_size`` is ``letter``."
msgstr ""
"``\"a4\"``\\ ；若 ``pdf_paper_size`` 为 ``letter``\\ ，则使用 "
"``\"us-letter\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:376
msgid "``numbering``"
msgstr "``numbering``"

#: ../../templates.rst:377
msgid "``true`` when a toctree has the ``numbered`` option."
msgstr "当 toctree 含 ``numbered`` 选项时为 ``true``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:378
msgid "``logo``"
msgstr "``logo``"

#: ../../templates.rst:379
msgid "The path of ``pdf_logo``; absent when it is unset."
msgstr "``pdf_logo`` 的路径；未设置则不传入。"

#: ../../templates.rst:380
msgid "``copyright``"
msgstr "``copyright``"

#: ../../templates.rst:381
msgid ""
"``copyright``, for the colophon. It is passed only to a template that "
"takes it."
msgstr "``copyright``，用于版权页。只有接受该参数的模板才会收到它。"

#: ../../templates.rst:383
msgid "The chapters."
msgstr "章节内容。"

#: ../../templates.rst:385
msgid ""
"A template may add parameters with defaults of its own. The template that "
"quickstart writes has ``accent``, the fonts ``serif``, ``sans``, and "
"``mono``, the text ``size``, and ``page-ref``. When ``page-ref`` is set "
"to a function such as ``n => [p. #n]``, cross-references to other pages "
"are followed by their page number."
msgstr ""
"模板可以添加自己的带默认值的参数。quickstart 写入的模板包含 ``accent``、字体 ``serif``、``sans`` 和 "
"``mono``、正文字号 ``size``，以及 ``page-ref``。将 ``page-ref`` 设为 ``n => [p. #n]`` "
"这样的函数后，指向其他页面的交叉引用后面会附上页码。"

#: ../../templates.rst:390
msgid "Modular Typst templates"
msgstr "模块化 Typst 模板"

#: ../../templates.rst:393
msgid ""
"Like HTML templates, Typst templates are not restricted to a single file. "
"We can split book styling, macros, and custom covers into several "
"``.typ`` files under ``_templates/``. Standard Typst ``#import`` and "
"``#include`` statements put them together:"
msgstr ""
"与 HTML 模板一样，Typst 模板也不必局限于单个文件。我们可以把书籍样式、宏和自定义封面拆分到 ``_templates/`` 下的多个 "
"``.typ`` 文件中，再用 Typst 标准的 ``#import`` 和 ``#include`` 语句组合起来："

#: ../../templates.rst:398
msgid "_templates/book.typ"
msgstr "_templates/book.typ"

#: ../../templates.rst:420
msgid ""
"Here ``apply-styles(body)`` must apply its rules around the content it "
"receives. A helper that sets text and returns nothing cannot change its "
"caller's later body. The complete tutorial shows a working wrapper around "
"the generated book template."
msgstr ""
"``apply-styles(body)`` "
"必须将样式规则包裹在传入的内容之外。一个仅设置文字样式并返回空值的函数，不能影响调用方后续的正文。完整教程给出了生成书籍模板的可用包装函数。"

#: ../../templates.rst:424
msgid "What a template can use"
msgstr "模板可以使用什么"

#: ../../templates.rst:427
msgid "Typst packages"
msgstr "Typst 包"

#: ../../templates.rst:428
msgid ""
"``#import \"@preview/cetz:0.4.2\"`` and other packages work, downloaded "
"on first use. Set ``pdf_packages = \"offline\"`` to build only with "
"packages already on disk."
msgstr ""
"``#import \"@preview/cetz:0.4.2\"`` 等包可用，首次使用时下载。设置 ``pdf_packages = "
"\"offline\"``\\ ，仅使用磁盘上已有的包构建。"

#: ../../templates.rst:431
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "字体"

#: ../../templates.rst:432
msgid ""
"The system's fonts are available, as with the ``typst`` command. Add "
"folders with ``pdf_font_paths``, or set ``pdf_fonts = \"embedded\"`` to "
"use only the fonts built into Typst, for byte-for-byte reproducible books."
msgstr ""
"可使用系统字体，与 ``typst`` 命令相同。通过 ``pdf_font_paths`` 增加目录；或设 ``pdf_fonts = "
"\"embedded\"``\\ ，只用 Typst 内置字体，实现逐字节可重复的书籍。"

#: ../../templates.rst:436
msgid "A preamble"
msgstr "前置内容"

#: ../../templates.rst:437
msgid ""
"``pdf_preamble`` names a Typst file whose content follows the ``#show: "
"book`` line. It suits a few ``set`` and ``show`` rules without a template "
"of our own."
msgstr ""
"``pdf_preamble`` 指定一个 Typst 文件，其内容放在 ``#show: book`` 这一行之后。如果只需要几条 "
"``set`` 和 ``show`` 规则，用它就够了，不必自己编写模板。"

#: ../../templates.rst:440
msgid "Typst in a document"
msgstr "文档中的 Typst"

#: ../../templates.rst:441
msgid ""
"Documents are reStructuredText and Markdown. Typst files are not "
"documents. To put Typst markup into the book, we write it in a raw block, "
"which web pages leave out:"
msgstr ""
"文档使用 reStructuredText 和 Markdown 编写，Typst 文件不是文档。要把 Typst "
"标记放进书籍，我们把它写在原始块中，网页会忽略这个块："

#: ../../templates.rst:450
msgid ""
"``.. only:: pdf`` keeps ordinary content to the book in the same way."
msgstr "``.. only:: pdf`` 也可将普通内容限制在图书中。"

#: ../../templates.rst:452
msgid ""
"When Typst reports an error, the build names the file and line, whether "
"it is in our template or in the generated book. Each PDF has its own "
"generated source at ``_build/pdf/sources/<pdf-filename>.typ``. For "
"example, ``reference-en.pdf`` has ``sources/reference-en.pdf.typ``. A "
"single-book build also keeps the familiar "
"``_build/pdf/book-<language>.typ`` inspection copy. A failed build "
"publishes nothing. Its source remains in ``_build/.doctrees/failed`` at "
"the path named by the error. Several books keep distinct failure sources."
msgstr ""
"Typst 报错时，构建会指出文件和行号，无论错误位于我们的模板中还是生成的书籍中。每个 PDF 都有自己生成的源文件，位于 "
"``_build/pdf/sources/<pdf-filename>.typ``。例如，``reference-en.pdf`` 对应 "
"``sources/reference-en.pdf.typ``。只构建一本书时，还会保留大家熟悉的 "
"``_build/pdf/book-<language>.typ`` 供检查。构建失败时不会发布任何内容，其源文件保留在 "
"``_build/.doctrees/failed`` 下，具体路径见错误信息。多本书各自保留独立的失败源文件。"

#: ../../templates.rst:461
msgid "Writing a new template"
msgstr "编写新模板"

#: ../../templates.rst:464
msgid ""
"We start from the copies quickstart wrote. They show every part in use:"
msgstr "我们从 quickstart 写入的模板副本入手，其中展示了每个部分的用法："

#: ../../templates.rst:466
msgid ""
"Keep the ``layout.html`` markup that the default style sheet expects, or "
"replace ``_static/guidedog.css`` along with it."
msgstr "保留默认样式表依赖的 ``layout.html`` 标记，或同时替换 ``_static/guidedog.css``\\ 。"

#: ../../templates.rst:468
msgid ""
"Move repeated parts into files of their own and ``include`` them, or put "
"a base layout in ``base.html`` and ``extends`` it from ``layout.html``."
msgstr ""
"将重复部分移入单独文件并用 ``include`` 引入，或建立 ``base.html``\\ ，让 ``layout.html`` 通过 "
"``extends`` 继承。"

#: ../../templates.rst:470
msgid ""
"For the book, change the ``book`` function's rules, or write a new "
"function with the same parameters and keep its name ``book``."
msgstr "图书可修改 ``book`` 函数中的规则，或写同名、同参数的新函数。"

#: ../../templates.rst:473
msgid ""
"Preview with ``guidedog serve`` while editing. Save the source and "
"refresh the browser. The server rebuilds changed inputs before serving "
"the page."
msgstr "编辑时用 ``guidedog serve`` 预览。保存源文件后刷新浏览器即可，服务器会先重新构建有变化的输入，再返回页面。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Guidedog renders ``layout.html`` with its own implementation of Jinja, "
#~ "so Jinja's whole language works: ``extends`` and ``block``, "
#~ "``include``, ``import`` and macros, ``set``, ``with``, loops with "
#~ "``loop``, filters, tests, and whitespace control. Output is "
#~ "autoescaped: a variable holding text is escaped, and the variables "
#~ "holding HTML (``body``, ``toc``, and ``outline``) are marked safe "
#~ "already."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Guidedog 用自己的 Jinja 实现渲染 ``layout.html``\\ ，支持 Jinja 全语言：\\ "
#~ "``extends``\\ 、\\ ``block``\\ 、\\ ``include``\\ 、\\ ``import``\\ 、宏、\\ "
#~ "``set``\\ 、\\ ``with``\\ 、带 ``loop`` "
#~ "的循环、过滤器、测试和空白控制。输出自动转义：文本变量会转义；HTML 变量 ``body``\\ 、\\ ``toc`` 和 "
#~ "``outline`` 已标为安全。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Guidedog looks for a template in each folder of ``templates_path`` in "
